#: ../install.sh:169
msgid ""
"Menu entry: \"Wi-Fi watchdog\" (right-click it for quick actions).\n"
"\n"
"Useful commands:\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog status             status and latest events\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog disconnect         disconnect manually (the watchdog will "
"not reconnect)\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog off                turn the Wi-Fi off until you turn it "
"back on\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog on                 turn on and reconnect\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog gui                open the desktop dialog\n"
"  sudo eduwifi-watchdog test          simulate a hang and verify it "
"recovers\n"
"  journalctl -t eduwifi-watchdog -f   follow the log"
msgstr ""
"Entrada del menú: «Vigilante de la Wi-Fi» (clic derecho para acciones "
"rápidas).\n"
"\n"
"Órdenes útiles:\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog status             estado y últimos eventos\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog disconnect         desconectar a mano (el vigilante no "
"reconectará)\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog off                apagar la Wi-Fi hasta que la vuelvas a "
"encender\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog on                 encender y reconectar\n"
"  eduwifi-watchdog gui                abrir el diálogo de escritorio\n"
"  sudo eduwifi-watchdog test          simular un cuelgue y comprobar que se "
"recupera\n"
"  journalctl -t eduwifi-watchdog -f   seguir el registro"

